55
00:08:43,008 --> 00:08:46,808
見上げれば 高すぎる空
If I look up, the sky is too high,

56
00:08:48,008 --> 00:08:52,508
眩暈がしても 止められないんだ
even if I feel dizzy, I can't stop.

57
00:08:53,008 --> 00:09:01,008
感情を滾らせながら
While letting my emotions surge,

58
00:09:01,508 --> 00:09:05,508
光求め もがいている 本能のscream
struggling for the light, the scream of instinct.

59
00:09:06,008 --> 00:09:14,508
停滞なんてぶち壊して 打ち壊してく
Shattering stagnation, smashing it apart.

60
00:09:15,008 --> 00:09:19,508
息を切らし不器用でも辿り着くから
Out of breath and clumsy, I'll still reach it,

61
00:09:19,808 --> 00:09:27,508
最短距離で駆け抜けたいたいんだ Like a Phoenix
I want to dash through the shortest distance. Like a Phoenix

62
00:09:42,008 --> 00:09:46,008
声を枯らしてもまだ
Even if my voice grows hoarse,

63
